     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Hi Ibrahim,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">You can double-check the semTools calculations again the HTMT computation spreadsheet tool available here:</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.pls-sem.net/downloads/sample-projects-and-various/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.pls-sem.net/downloads/sample-projects-and-various/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423568242000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LiDag4IGmrJBPg4JahgC8\">https://www.pls-sem.net/downloads/sample-projects-and-various/</a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">As far as I know, the results are the same.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Regards,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Theuns</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
